  "description": "The lower back. In the midline the spinous processes and the supraspinous and interspinous ligaments lead, deep to the ligamentum flavum, to the dural sac and the cauda equina. Either side, the erector spinae lie in the thoracolumbar fascia over quadratus lumborum and psoas; the kidneys lie deep in the retroperitoneum at the levels of the upper lumbar vertebrae, and above about L1 the costodiaphragmatic recess of the pleura extends laterally.",
